  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/f613a19ae2c56e0f514d4a0d7758f129a565f53e8dd4cb012eca86f34c417afb.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><strong>Sai</strong>.<br>\n\t\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, theo cách xây dựng hệ trục tọa độ thì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><strong>Đúng</strong>.<br>\n\t\t\tVì theo cách xây dựng hệ trục tọa độ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tSuy ra tọa độ của véctơ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><strong>Đúng</strong>.<br>\n\t\t\tVì theo quy tắc hình bình hành ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><strong>Sai</strong>.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>18</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>61</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>18</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>61</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTừ đó ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>1201</mn></msqrt><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>61</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>89</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
